  "ruleText": "Pda 101.18 “Emergency repair” means the restoration of a broken component(s) of a vessel, failure of which to do would impede the safe navigation of the vessel.\n\nSource. #7847, eff 3-8-03; renumbered by #8298 (from Pda 101.15); ss by #8760, eff 11-18-06",
